OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 70s dies after flat fire
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died after a fire in a flat,
OL,6,Fpolice have said.
OL,8,FOfficers were called by paramedics at
OL,9,Fabout 20:25 BST on Thursday to a flat
OL,10,Ffire in Torquay, Devon.
OL,12,FPolice said the man, in his 70s,
OL,13,Freceived treatment but despite the
OL,14,Fefforts of paramedics he died at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FA police cordon is in place while
OL,18,Finvestigations continue to determine
OL,19,Fthe cause of the fire.
